AltoLeverageSwapperForWrapperToken::setValidSwapTarget
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when swapTarget is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperInvalidInput
    ├── when isValid status is unchanged
    │   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperInvalidInput
    └── when isValid status changes
        ├── when setting to true
        │   ├── it should update isValidSwapTarget mapping
        │   └── it should emit SetValidSwapTarget
        └── when setting to false
            ├── it should update isValidSwapTarget mapping
            └── it should emit SetValidSwapTarget
